   "proposition": "The English introduces faceting as 'a second option'; the translation presents the faceting code as 'a few notes on the code below' and never identifies it as one of several approaches.",
   "reader_consequence": "The translation still promises 'one of the approaches below' but then offers a single unlabelled technique, so a Turkish reader cannot tell which approach is being shown or that any alternative exists.",
